# Upload ONLY the estimate builder web app to Vercel.
# Everything else in this folder (presentations, images, the Android project,
# its signing key, the APK) stays on this computer.
/*
!/web
!/vercel.json

# local-only helper, not needed on the website
/web/*.bat

# safety net: never upload signing keys or their passwords, wherever they are
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.properties
**/keystore
*.apk
